 "prompt": "On a bustling city sidewalk café, six round tables host patrons sipping coffee and reading newspapers. Each table is shaded by a striped canvas umbrella and set with a ceramic coffee cup, a glass of water, and a small sugar bowl. A waitress carries a tray of croissants past a row of black wrought-iron chairs lined against a brick wall. Potted lavender and rosemary plants sit on wrought-iron stands beside a chalkboard menu propped on an easel. A dog sits patiently beside a wooden bench, and a bicycle leans against a nearby lamppost. A stack of glossy magazines rests on a side table, and a wrought-iron bicycle basket holds a bouquet of daisies. There is no plastic sign, no electric scooter, no aerosol can, no paper flyer, and no umbrella that’s plain white.",
